**Italian Social Movement (MSI):** [? if year < 1972 : 24 seats ?][? if year >= 1972 and year < 1976 : MSI–Monarchists 56 seats ?][? if year >= 1976 and year < 1979 : MSI–National Right 35 seats ?][? if year >= 1979 and year < 1983 : 30 seats ?][? if year >= 1983 : 42 seats ?]

